      "id": "AWS.AspNetCore.DistributedCacheProvider",
      "range": "*"
    },
    "message": "If you are using the AWS Session State Provider for .NET, we recommend migrating to the AWS .NET Distributed Cache Provider, which is our current solution for storing session state in Amazon DynamoDB for ASP.NET Core applications. It supports the IDistributedCache interface and is designed for modern .NET development patterns.\n\nFor setup instructions and migration guidance, please refer to the documentation and samples provided in the GitHub repository https://github.com/aws/aws-dotnet-distributed-cache-provider.",
    "reasons": [
      "Legacy"
    ]
  },
